<title>USA: Ocean Optique Q3 net profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Ocean Optique Q3 net profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended March 31,</p>
<p>						    1997		1996</p>
<p> Revenues from operations	  $ 3,208,840	$ 3,740,919</p>
<p> Net Profit (loss)			 214,200	(1,203,758)</p>
<p> Average shares			  3,066,563	  2,149,175</p>
<p> Earnings per share			   0.07	     (0.56)</p>
<p>(with consideration for</p>
<p>dividends on Preferred Stock)</p>
<p>-----</p>
<p>Nine months ended March 31,</p>
<p>						   1997		 1996</p>
<p> Revenues from operations	  $ 9,473,152	$10,644,836</p>
<p> Net loss				  (439,191)	(2,031,747)</p>
<p> Average shares			  2,778,500	  2,126,818</p>
<p> Earnings per share			 (0.17)	     (0.95)</p>
<p>(with consideration of</p>
<p>dividends on Preferred Stock)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Ocean Optique Distributor Inc said its third quarter period ended March 31.</p>
<p>The company said it generated profits in the third quarter of 1997 mainly through inventory controls and major reductions of selling, general and administrative expenses.</p>
